# ERA Data Hub — local development

**Inherits:** monorepo root `.cursor/rules/`. Port **4200** (`docs/ECOSYSTEM_URLS.md`).

## Stack

- **API only:** NestJS `apps/api` (`@era/data-hub-api`)
- **Schema:** `packages/database/prisma/schema.prisma`

## Commands (from `era-data-hub/`)

| Command | Purpose |
|---------|---------|
| `npm run dev` | API watch mode (loads root `.env`) |
| `npm run db:generate` | Prisma client |
| `npm run db:migrate` / `db:migrate:deploy` | Migrations |
| `npm run db:seed` | Seed reference data |
| `npm run db:sync-from-finance` | Sync catalog from finance |

## Env

`DATABASE_URL`, service tokens for ingest from finance/satellites as configured in `.env.example`.

No Next.js web in this repo — API-only service.
